  <Properties>
    <Name>JFD's [COLOR_FLOAT_GOLD]Poland[ENDCOLOR]: Stanislaw II</Name>
    <Description>------------------------------------[NEWLINE]LEADER -- STANISLAW II[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]TRAIT - COMMISSION FOR NATIONAL EDUCATION[NEWLINE]Build Theatre Square districts in half the usual time. Theatre Square Buildings and Great Works of Writing yield +2 [ICON_SCIENCE] Science. Gain the Uhlan unique unit when they research the Metal Casting technology.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]UNIT - UHLAN[NEWLINE]Polish unique Renaissance era unit that replaces the Cavalry when Stanislaw II is their leader. Receives a combat bonus when flanking.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]AGENDA - THURSDAY DINNERS[NEWLINE]Likes civilizations with a high [ICON_CULTURE] Culture output. Will try to employ as many Great People as possible and will respect those who do the same. Dislikes civilizations who neglect to patronise Great People.</Description>
    <Created>1595713901</Created>
    <Teaser>Adds Stanislaw II to Poland. Click for details.</Teaser>
    <Authors>Janboruta, JFD, Deliverator</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>Brackenspore, Merrowin, zebenji</SpecialThanks>
    <CompatibleVersions>1.2,2.0</CompatibleVersions>
